<title>AUSTRALIA: Hudson sees higher 1997 profits.</title>
<headline>Hudson sees higher 1997 profits.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hardware retailer and securities firm Hudson Timber and Hardware Ltd said on Friday that it expected to achieve further profit growth in calendar 1997.</p>
<p>The company told shareholders at the annual meeting that the timber and hardware division were expected to continue improving, particularly in the second half while the securities and investment activities were also set for a significant contribution provided sharemarkets remained buoyant.</p>
<p>Hudson reported a 157 percent rise in 1996 net profit to A$825,000.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
